FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">광주 이동버스 운영 예정<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">* </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">위 일정은 변동 가능성이 있으며</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">탑승위치 및 세부사항들은 신청 화면에서 확인 가능합니다</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">.<br><br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\">※ </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">수강신청 하신 분 중 희망자 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">주소 입력 하신분</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">께 선착순으로 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">현대자동차의 취업플래너 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">H Book</span><span style=\